  "body": "*Estimated Completion: April 2027*\r\n\r\nThere are zero reasons to wait with our latest offer! **For a limited time**, buyers can secure a brand-new Wolfbrook home with **Zero Deposit*** needed upfront and enjoy **$10K Cashback***.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, your next home, or investing in property, there's zero reasons to wait. **Offer ends 31 October**. *T&Cs apply.\r\n\r\n**Modern Homes in Sought-After Glendowie**\r\n\r\nPresenting 5 Karaka Park Place, Glendowie — a standout collection of nine architecturally designed homes that combine style, functionality, and contemporary living in one of Auckland’s most sought-after suburbs.\r\n\r\nCrafted with care and attention to detail, each home boasts open-plan living, modern kitchens, and private outdoor spaces — perfect for entertaining or unwinding in comfort. Spacious interiors with premium finishes, and low-maintenance landscaping come together to deliver easy, elegant living.\r\n\r\nThis exclusive release features a mix of two- and three- bedroom homes, each offering either two or two-and- a-half bathrooms, along with an off-street car park for everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a first-home buyer, a growing family, or a savvy investor, 5 Karaka Park Place offers an amazing opportunity to secure a brand-new home in this popular\r\ncoastal neighbourhood.\r\n\r\n**The Location**\r\nPerfectly positioned in one of Auckland’s most desirable suburbs, Glendowie offers the ideal mix of relaxed coastal living and everyday practicality. This peaceful neighbourhood is known for its strong community feel, excellent schooling, and access to nature. \r\n\r\nFrom here, you’re just minutes from the scenic walking trails of Churchill Park, the calm waters of Karaka Bay Beach, and panoramic views at Achilles Point — perfect for weekend\r\nadventures or evening strolls. Glover Park and Glendowie Park also offer wide green spaces for play, picnics, and recreation.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate zoning for top local schools including Churchill Park School,  Glendowie College, and Sacred Heart College. Daily convenience is covered too, with Glen Innes town centre, supermarkets, Chemist Warehouse, and train links nearby — plus Eastridge and Meadowbank Shopping Centres just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nCity commuters can be in the Auckland CBD or at Mission Bay in no time. Whether you’re raising a family or simply seeking a quiet, well-connected neighbourhood with coastal charm, Glendowie delivers lifestyle, location, and long-term appeal. \r\n\r\n**Why Wolfbrook?** \r\nAs one of New Zealand's premier property developers, Wolfbrook Residential excels in delivering top-tier, tailor-made homes for homeowners and investors alike. Our track record speaks of our commitment to quality and craftsmanship. We understand that each property demands a unique approach. Wolfbrook goes beyond mere construction; we partner with you to achieve your financial goals and unlock the path to financial freedom.\r\n\r\n**Considering adding to your property portfolio?** As well as offering great tenant appeal, each home delivers an impressive gross rental yield – making it one of the smartest, turnkey buys available right now. Plus, Wolfbrook offers a ***2 Year Rental Guarantee**** when you choose to have your property professionally managed by us — giving you even greater peace of mind from day one.  \r\n\r\n**Want a closer look at a completed Wolfbrook home?** Visit our Auckland showhome at **1/15 Line Road, Glen Innes, open every Saturday 11am–1pm.** \r\n\r\nIt’s the perfect opportunity to walk through a finished Wolfbrook home, chat with our team, and see the quality and design you can expect when you purchase with us. We’d love to see you there! \r\n\r\n*T&C’s apply please visit https://wolfbrook.co.nz/resources/terms-conditions-zero-deposit-10k-cashback-offer",
